  <!-- EVE Online themed pirate factions and CONCORD police/bounty faction.
       All new factions have NO stations. Pirates are hostile only to the player
       and neutral to everyone else (including CONCORD), so they never attack
       other NPC factions. Other NPC factions are neutral to the new factions,
       so they do not help or attack them. -->

